  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 302.04 Term of Business Entity Licensure. An initial business entity license issued under this chapter shall be valid for 2 years.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 301.05); (formerly Saf-Mec 302.04); ss by #14482, eff 2-13-26, EXPIRES: 2-13-36",
